/* PASO source: "PASO uses your contacts so you can search and reference people while using the assistant." */
"NSContactsUsageDescription" = "PASO menggunakan kontak Anda agar Anda dapat mencari dan merujuk orang saat menggunakan asisten.";
/* PASO source: "PASO discovers and connects to your PASO gateway on the local network." */
"NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription" = "PASO menemukan dan terhubung ke gateway PASO Anda di jaringan lokal.";
/* PASO source: "PASO can share your location in the background when you enable Always." */
"NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "PASO dapat membagikan lokasi Anda di latar belakang saat Anda mengaktifkan Selalu.";
/* PASO source: "PASO uses your location when you allow location sharing." */
